    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**A DEPOSIT HAS NOW BEEN TAKEN. SIMILAR PROPERTIES REQUIRED FOR READY TO GO UNDER BIDDERS**\r\nDowling Property Baldoyle, is delighted to present to the market, this stunning 2 bed apartment for sale in this stellar location. This spacious apartment is located in this highly sought after location and enjoys a host of high quality amenities on your doorstep that the thriving village of Baldoyle has to offer.\r\n\r\nThis bright & spacious apartment is light filled and enjoys a sunny south facing aspect and comes with a very energy efficient BER rating of B3. The feature list is impressive and includes 2 double bedroom, gas heating, designated parking and a large open plan living room and kitchen. The real highlight is the bathroom which has just undergone a very tasteful renovation and is a real show stopper.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation extends to c.60 sq.mt and has been tastefully decorated throughout and is ready for it's lucky new owner to \"walk in and hang up their hat\"!! Baldoyle is a bustling community with a superb selection of both primary and secondary schools, leisure activities and is located just a short walk the sea front. There is a choice of dart stations including Clongriffin and Bayside with excellent services to both City Centre and north to Malahide. With it's convenient location and stunning layout, we must now strongly advise an early viewing as we predict this gem of a property will not be on sale for long.\r\n\r\nVendors Highlight-The pure south facing aspect makes our home light filled and easy to heat.\r\n\r\nAgents Favourite-The choice of having 2 different dart stations close by which service different lines is absolutely fantastic.#\r\n\r\nCall Dowling Property Baldoyle on 012118222 or email baldoyle@dowlingproperty.ie"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The accommodation, which is bright and spacious and well laid out, briefly consists of entrance hallway, 2 double bedrooms, bathroom and open plan kitchen/living room.\r\n\r\nAll amenities are located on your doorstep which include a selection of both primary and secondary schools, childcare, shopping in the Racecourse Shopping Centre with Lidl, pharmacy, barber shop, ladies hair salon and coffee/restaurant shop, etc. Baldoyle also boasts the brand new & state of the art Stapolin Educate Together National School. There is a vast array of leisure activities and all just a short distance to the sea."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - \r\nA welcoming hallway with wooden floor, storage room\r\n\r\nLiving/Kitchen - 5.25m x 4.8m \r\nThe heart beat of this beautiful apartment is this light filled living area, which enjoys a south facing aspect. There's a stylish fully fitted kitchen with built in oven and hob, intrigrated dishwasher, and washing machine. The floor area is part tiled and wooden.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.65m x 2.9m \r\nA generous sized master bedroom with built in wardrobes. Carpet floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 2.6m x 217.0m \r\nA double bedroom with built in wardrobes. Carpet floor.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.67m x 1.98m \r\nTastefully tiled floor and walls. Bath and step in shower, w.c. and w.h.b.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Excellent Condition Throughout\r\n2 Double Bedrooms\r\nGas Heating\r\nRecently Renovated Bathroom\r\nAll Appliances Included In Sale\r\nHealthy B3 Energy Rating\r\nDesignated Parking\r\nWalking Distance To All Amenities\r\nHighly Sought After Area \r\nShort Walking Distance to Dart Station\r\nAccommodation c.60sq.mt"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B3"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
